      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Sefirit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Sefirit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How about Kismet's Jinx that give you -1 damage.&nbsp; Can I choose to apply that to one Sentinel and then have the source of the damage be a different one?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It would reduce the damage of which Sentinel it was currently attached too.</p>",
